          "item": {
            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "Zepto Receives SEBI Approval for $1 Billion IPO, Clearing Path to Public Markets",
            "articleSection": "Daily Utility",
            "abstract": "Quick commerce startup Zepto has received SEBI's observations on its draft red herring prospectus, effectively securing regulatory clearance to proceed with its $1 billion initial public offering. SEBI issued the observations between May 4 and 8 as part of a batch covering six companies, marking a significant milestone for one of India's fastest-growing consumer tech startups. The IPO will be among the largest in India's new-age tech sector and reflects growing investor confidence in quick commerce as a durable business model.",
            "url": "https://yourstory.com/2026/05/zepto-receives-approval-for-its-1-bn-ipo",
            "publisher": {
